= J. S. Woodsworth

James Woodsworth is a former methodist minister, and one of the most recognizable and well-known Democratic Socialist leaders. He is the [+ party_names.ccf +]'s Party Leader.

J. S. Woodsworth [? if ccf_prussia = 1 : is ?][? if ccf_prussia = 0 : was ?] the Minister-Prime Minister of City Police, the largest state in Saskatchewan. He is a moderate leader who seeks to work with the bourgeois parties.

- @coalition
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: J.S. Woodsworth can improve our relationships with our centrist and center-right coalition partners in City Police as well as in the Assembly.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (ccf_prussia or in_lps_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_unity_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not ccf_prussia : The [+ party_names.ccf +] does not control the Urban government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if ccf_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; pps_relation += 6; lps_relation += 6; pcps_relation += 2; pcps_relation += 3 if in_grand_coalition

We have improved our relations with the [? if in_grand_coalition : PPS Party, [+ party_names.lps +], and PCPS, ?][? if not in_grand_coalition: PPS Party and [+ party_names.lps +], ?] and reduced tensions with the coalition.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if premier != "J. S. Woodsworth" and prime_minister != "J. S. Woodsworth" : J. S. Woodsworth must be Premier or Prime Minister. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if prime_minister = "J. S. Woodsworth" and prime_ministerial_powers : We have removed this power from the prime minister with a constitutional reform. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (premier == "J. S. Woodsworth" or (prime_minister == "J. S. Woodsworth" and not prime_ministerial_powers))
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_parl_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_parl_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_parl_election_year += 1 if next_parl_election_month > 12; next_parl_election_month -= 12 if next_parl_election_month > 12; 

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_parl_election_month : month +] [+ next_parl_election_year +].
